  "title": "We Finally Know What The Rothschilds Are Buying",
  "type": "vol_commentary",
  "priority": "medium",
  "published": "2026-08-17",
  "insights": [
   "Edmond de Rothschild views the current AI cycle as a bubble similar to the 1999 dot-com era, yet advises maintaining long exposure while gradually rebalancing.",
